			<v n="1">restored the fortunes of Jacob.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19085002">
			</marker>
			<v n="2">covered all their sin. Selah</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19085003">
			</marker>
			<v n="3">turned from your hot anger.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19085004">
			</marker>
			<v n="4">and put away your indignation toward us!</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19085005">
			</marker>
			<v n="5">Will you prolong your anger to all generations?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19085006">
			</marker>
			<v n="6">rejoice in you?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19085007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">and grant us your salvation.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19085008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">folly.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19085009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">glory may dwell in our land.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19085010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">righteousness and peace kiss each other.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19085011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">and righteousness looks down from the sky.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19085012">
			</marker>
